{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的大字经常把多个意思和情绪层次放在同一句里，扫读时主次不如Y鲜明，尤其不容易一眼抓住每段的核心。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的标题更利落，每段的主要事件一眼就能抓住，但不少关键动机、因果关系和情绪转折被放进小字，普通观众扫一眼容易只记住发生了什么，却不完全明白为什么。X虽然阅读负担更大，却把人物从最初害怕成为负担，到后来害怕失去亲近，再到接受不确定性的心理变化保留得更完整，尤其S11至S14的情绪递进和前后呼应更细腻。综合来看，我选X：它牺牲了一些扫读效率，换来了更完整的人物理解和情感连续性。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "45aad95c-cb1a-4d37-a155-2630fc075e25", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T195621864870Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:57:50.990885+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a64a8cbb113643448852af77e8a5cc65841dba1f119f243fd9fa1bf7e6bfbe38", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment